### CADASTRAR FUNCIONARIO
POST http://localhost:5043/api/folha/cadastrar
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Ana Souza",
    "cpf": "123.456.789-00",
    "mes": 10,
    "ano": 2025,
    "horasTrabalhadas": 160,
    "valorHora": 50
}

### LISTAR FUNCIONARIOS
GET http://localhost:5043/api/folha/listar

### BUSCAR FUNCIONARIO
GET http://localhost:5043/api/folha/buscar/123.456.789-00/10/2025

### DELETAR FUNCIONARIO
DELETE http://localhost:5043/api/folha/remover/123.456.789-00/10/2025

### SALARIO TOTAL LIQUIDO
GET http://localhost:5043/api/folha/total-liquido